<strong>📖 File Description & Reference:</strong><br>
• This panel only allows editing files in <code>pics/</code>, <code>data/</code>, <code>tpl/</code>. Any existing file in these directories can be added here for online editing.<br>
• <strong>Do not rename or delete</strong> existing files in <code>pics/</code>, <code>data/</code>, <code>tpl/</code>.<br>
• <code>pics/</code> — Frontend assets (CSS/JS/images), referenced as <code>/pics/filename</code><br>
• <strong>Reserved filename patterns (auto-generated, but editable):</strong><br>
• <code>data/add_*.log</code> — Generated by admin page creation; edits take effect immediately in the corresponding admin panel<br>
• <code>tpl/code_{key}.log</code> — Generated by code/api routes; edits take effect with the route<br>
• <code>tpl/ajax_{type}.log</code> — For AJAX routes; freely add/edit; invoked via <code>openshow('type')</code><br>
• <u>tpl/code_ajax.log is the built-in popup overlay handler — do NOT modify or delete.</u><br>
• <code>data/</code> — Data files, read by PHP via <code>include</code> / <code>file_get_contents</code><br>